\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Thou whose almighty word
\par Chaos and darkness heard,
\par And took their flight,
\par Hear us, we humbly pray,
\par And where the gospel day
\par Sheds not its glorious ray
\par Let there be light!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thou who didst come to bring
\par On Thy redeeming wing
\par Healing and sight,
\par Health to the sick in mind,
\par Sight to the inly blind
\par O now to all mankind
\par Let there be light!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Spirit of truth and love,
\par Life-giving, holy Dove  
\par Speed forth Thy flight;
\par Move on the waters face,
\par Spreading the beams of grace,
\par And in earth's darkest place
\par Let there be light!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Blessed and holy Three
\par Glorious Trinity,
\par Grace, love, and might,
\par Boundless as ocean's tide
\par Rolling in fullest pride,
\par Through the world, far and wide
\par Let there be light!
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

